          "guid": "mt5fyt00yxhuimwo",
          "message": {
            "text": "The zoom rows discriminate used-state ownership rather than raster tolerance. On pinned Noble arm64, the explicit 3px/2px Times double underline at zoom 1.25 first exposed a 1-2px SVG logical mismatch; after scaling absolute lengths once, all exact legs pass: 109/109 transcription, 30/30 skip-ink, 109/109 SVG geometry.",
            "markdown": "The zoom rows discriminate used-state ownership rather than raster tolerance. On pinned Noble arm64, the explicit 3px/2px Times double underline at zoom 1.25 first exposed a 1-2px SVG logical mismatch; after scaling absolute lengths once, all exact legs pass: 109/109 transcription, 30/30 skip-ink, 109/109 SVG geometry."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "tools/decoration-oracle.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 331,
                  "endLine": 336,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "  // 16. CSS zoom controls. These cross auto geometry, explicit geometry, and\n  // skip-ink at non-integral/integral scales; zoom=1 is the entire matrix's\n  // neutral arm rather than a duplicate row.\n  push({ family: \"Helvetica\", fontSize: 24, lines: \"underline\", style: \"solid\", zoom: 0.8 });\n  push({ family: \"Times\", fontSize: 24, lines: \"underline\", style: \"double\", thickness: \"3px\", underlineOffset: \"2px\", zoom: 1.25 });\n  push({ family: \"Helvetica\", fontSize: 16, lines: \"underline\", style: \"solid\", skipInk: true, text: \"jumping gaps\", zoom: 2 });"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
